[{"y0": 0.04505813942188486, "y1": 0.0624999999676501, "x0": 0.17857143016627183, "x1": 0.25751879638448, "t": "GATE"}, {"y0": 0.0465116280750707, "y1": 0.06249999995303002, "x0": 0.2875939907261634, "x1": 0.7180450998440121, "t": "Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering 2021"}, {"y0": 0.061046511660256875, "y1": 0.07848837220602212, "x0": 0.18045112634884372, "x1": 0.25751879749984047, "t": "2021"}, {"y0": 0.06540697686988661, "y1": 0.08139534874784593, "x0": 0.334586462010652, "x1": 0.6597744321152881, "t": "Organising Institute - IT Bombay"}, {"y0": 0.0901162788114197, "y1": 0.10755813935718495, "x0": 0.33082708572583125, "x1": 0.8477443473098829, "t": "Computer Science and Information Technology (CS, Set-1)"}, {"y0": 0.126453488540187, "y1": 0.14244186041814633, "x0": 0.15225563454510926, "x1": 0.8496240530802044, "t": "Q.48 - Q.55 Numerical Answer Type (NAT), carry TWO mark each (no negative marks)."}, {"y0": 0.19040697666288509, "y1": 0.20348837236120132, "x0": 0.16353383448780445, "x1": 0.2011278195401225, "t": "Q.48"}, {"y0": 0.1903030302142562, "y1": 0.20203488369936362, "x0": 0.23684211165162475, "x1": 0.5338345899774476, "t": "Consider the following ANSI C function:"}, {"y0": 0.21802325627170427, "y1": 0.23110465081405152, "x0": 0.23496240916977748, "x1": 0.5939849502757115, "t": "int SimpleFunction(int YI, int n, int x)"}, {"y0": 0.24848484863004683, "y1": 0.26181818196338014, "x0": 0.2518796969423508, "x1": 0.49812029484962944, "t": "int total = Y[O], loopIndex;"}, {"y0": 0.26424242406103926, "y1": 0.27761627930506894, "x0": 0.25375939328258573, "x1": 0.7067669149567629, "t": "for (loopIndex = 1; loopIndex <= n - 1; loopIndex++)"}, {"y0": 0.280523256144524, "y1": 0.29360465068687125, "x0": 0.33270677677692756, "x1": 0.6221804509173077, "t": "total = x * total + Y[loopIndex];"}, {"y0": 0.29636363633379414, "y1": 0.30969696966712745, "x0": 0.25375939880937015, "x1": 0.36842105501268496, "t": "return total;"}, {"y0": 0.3125000000192293, "y1": 0.32267441838193345, "x0": 0.23496240590981365, "x1": 0.24436090217289316, "t": "}"}, {"y0": 0.3386627908803884, "y1": 0.3533333333950739, "x0": 0.23308271017669632, "x1": 0.8364661720601455, "t": "Let Z be an array of 10 elements with Z[i] =1, for all i such that 0 \u2264 i \u2264 9. The"}, {"y0": 0.3545454545193114, "y1": 0.3678787878526447, "x0": 0.234962408282876, "x1": 0.571428560749079, "t": "value returned by SimpleFunction(Z, 10, 2) is"}, {"y0": 0.43895348890615193, "y1": 0.4520348834484992, "x0": 0.1635338344663222, "x1": 0.20112781951864023, "t": "Q.49"}, {"y0": 0.4375000003124019, "y1": 0.45058139485474924, "x0": 0.23684211293828256, "x1": 0.8364661727290104, "t": "Consider the sliding window flow-control protocol operating between a sender and"}, {"y0": 0.4533333331967315, "y1": 0.4680232555294952, "x0": 0.23496241629697678, "x1": 0.7236842100188126, "t": "a receiver over a full-duplex error-free link. Assume the following: |"}, {"y0": 0.4694767442960861, "y1": 0.4842424242046074, "x0": 0.23496240572432217, "x1": 0.7932330903283092, "t": "\u2022 The time taken for processing the data frame by the receiver is negligible."}, {"y0": 0.4854545457190018, "y1": 0.5000000002644563, "x0": 0.23308271118233545, "x1": 0.8364661730657847, "t": "\u2022 The time taken for processing the acknowledgement frame by the sender is neg-"}, {"y0": 0.5014534887571693, "y1": 0.5145348832995167, "x0": 0.24624060250391536, "x1": 0.30827067724232515, "t": "ligible."}, {"y0": 0.5174418605109078, "y1": 0.5290909090560516, "x0": 0.2349624163007035, "x1": 0.7499999768383945, "t": "\u2022 The sender has infinite number of frames available for transmission."}, {"y0": 0.5333333335862142, "y1": 0.5450581397071155, "x0": 0.23496241168671872, "x1": 0.8364661725238073, "t": "\u2022 The size of the data frame is 2,000 bits and the size of the acknowledgement"}, {"y0": 0.5494186046242798, "y1": 0.5612121209567328, "x0": 0.24812030232157445, "x1": 0.3778195429791776, "t": "frame is 10 bits."}, {"y0": 0.5639534887146909, "y1": 0.5787878788347637, "x0": 0.2330827073251709, "x1": 0.7706766804191904, "t": "\u2022 The link data rate in each direction is 1 Mbps (= 10\u00b0 bits per second)."}, {"y0": 0.581212121202667, "y1": 0.5945454545360003, "x0": 0.23496241188533204, "x1": 0.6804511293740664, "t": "\u2022 One way propagation delay of the link is 100 milliseconds."}, {"y0": 0.5945346228970473, "y1": 0.6119666675331668, "x0": 0.23486389019536544, "x1": 0.8365762037607064, "t": "The minimum value of the sender's window size in terms of the number of frames,"}, {"y0": 0.6119186048363845, "y1": 0.6249999993787317, "x0": 0.23496239533333577, "x1": 0.8364661561704243, "t": "(rounded to the nearest integer) needed to achieve a link utilization of 50% is"}, {"y0": 0.7063953490335656, "y1": 0.7223837209115249, "x0": 0.16353383512673453, "x1": 0.2030075182358386, "t": "Q.50"}, {"y0": 0.7078488374065512, "y1": 0.7224242425274009, "x0": 0.23496241394484751, "x1": 0.5244360880852276, "t": "Consider the following C code segment:"}, {"y0": 0.7540078811470944, "y1": 0.766340955774595, "x0": 0.2536824351907767, "x1": 0.34030252683535084, "t": "a = b + c:"}, {"y0": 0.7715484477650137, "y1": 0.7836841106530493, "x0": 0.2537047018923644, "x1": 0.3421599618791701, "t": "e = a + 1;"}, {"y0": 0.7861842422390217, "y1": 0.7995715720341655, "x0": 0.25184302890336596, "x1": 0.3421419356661378, "t": "d = b + c;"}, {"y0": 0.8023255820166171, "y1": 0.8154069765589644, "x0": 0.2518797023750734, "x1": 0.3421052629131471, "t": "f = d + 1;"}, {"y0": 0.8181818183946626, "y1": 0.8315151517279961, "x0": 0.2537594017156096, "x1": 0.34210526120732265, "t": "g = e + f;"}, {"y0": 0.863372092930933, "y1": 0.8793939393553826, "x0": 0.23308270597086933, "x1": 0.8364661678543186, "t": "In a compiler, this code segment is represented internally as a directed acyclic graph"}, {"y0": 0.8793604653836947, "y1": 0.895348837261654, "x0": 0.23308270359743394, "x1": 0.5601503747484307, "t": "(DAG). The number of nodes in the DAG is"}, {"y0": 0.9460606063338094, "y1": 0.9607558137562393, "x0": 0.152255639351496, "x1": 0.3966165362124139, "t": "CS, Set-1 - Copyright \u00a9 GATE 2021"}, {"y0": 0.9459829266933698, "y1": 0.9595403295642416, "x0": 0.7537049724271572, "x1": 0.8477987854713076, "t": "Page 38 of 40"}]